CreateElementsSessionRequestDto.description:
Creates an Elements session: the partner builds the payment UI with the Flute Elements SDK and
hands it the returned paymentSessionId. The fields here are the ones every session type shares;
a Checkout session adds the hosted-page ones.

ExtraAmountsDto.description:
Tip and discount inputs for a new transaction. A card transaction applies the tip and the discount;
an ACH debit applies only the discount and ignores the tip. A discount applies only when the merchant
has percentage off enabled.

extraFields.description:
The customer's answers to the extra fields of the payment link or checkout session that produced
this transaction, in the order shown to the customer. Optional fields left blank are omitted;
empty when there are none.

taxRate.description:
Tax rate percentage, 0 to 100, with up to 3 decimal places. The merged link must keep
taxMode set together with exactly one of taxRate and taxAmount, or all three cleared;
switching a link to taxAmount therefore needs an explicit null here.

parameters.description:
Filter by settlement batch id (UUID). Pass the literal value `null`
(`batchId=null`) to return transactions not yet settled into a batch;
omit the parameter to not filter by batch.
